OpenBahía Transit studied the public architecture of ColectivosYa
(https://github.com/corzofederico/gpsbus-web, Apache-2.0) and the
historical AGPL poller https://github.com/cualbondi/poller.

Parsers in this repository were written from observed public JSON
shapes and are original code. No Firebase Admin credentials are
included. The Firebase web client identifiers documented in
docs/realtime-sources.md are the same values already published in
gpsbus-web.
